msgid "telegram.admin.import.title"
msgstr "Import the final volunteer list"

msgid "telegram.admin.import.info"
msgstr "Do this once, when the shifts are final. Paste CSV rows: handle, name, area, shifts, lead. Shifts look like \"2026-11-03 AM; 2026-11-04 PM\", lead is \"yes\" for leads. Each row creates an account with area, lead role and shifts; people who already exist are skipped and not changed."

