msgid "telegram.admin.unlink.title"
msgstr "Reset a Telegram link"

msgid "telegram.admin.unlink.info"
msgstr "For a wrong handle or when the wrong person connected: removes the account's bot chat and Telegram login and logs them out. Afterwards the account waits for the Telegram username you enter, or its Engelsystem username if left empty."

